---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
import { getPosts, postUrl } from '../lib/posts';
import { localePath, type Locale } from '../lib/i18n';
import { UI } from '../lib/ui';

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
const t = UI[locale];
// "The first post" is Hello World, which tells the story of the name (the oldest post if it is ever renamed).
const posts = await getPosts(locale);
const first = posts.find((post) => post.id === 'hello-world') ?? posts.at(-1);
const rss = localePath(locale, '/rss.xml');
---
<BaseLayout locale={locale} title={t.about.title} description={t.about.description} mainClass="container article-layout no-rail">
  <article class="sheet" aria-labelledby="post-title">
    <header class="post-head">
      <h1 id="post-title">{t.about.title}</h1>
    </header>

    {locale === 'zh' ? (
      <figure class="motto">
        <blockquote><p>日就月将，学有缉熙于光明。</p></blockquote>
        <p class="motto-gloss">每天有所收获，每月有所长进；学习不断积累，终会通达光明。</p>
        <figcaption><cite>《诗经·周颂·敬之》</cite></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="prose" lang="zh-CN">
        <p>缉熙（<span lang="en">Dawning</span>）是一名 AI 工程师的笔名，做检索增强生成（RAG）系统、多智能体工作流和 LLM 应用。这个站点是一本工作笔记：设计笔记、失败模式、评测，以及偶尔让我改变看法的结果。</p>

        <h2 id="the-name">名字</h2>
        <p>“缉熙”出自《诗经·周颂·敬之》，说的是学习日积月累，渐渐通向光明。英文名 Dawning 说的是同一件事：天色渐渐亮起来，一个想法慢慢变得清楚。{first ? <a href={postUrl(first)}>第一篇文章</a> : '第一篇文章'}讲了更完整的由来。</p>

        <h2 id="elsewhere">别处</h2>
        <ul class="link-list">
          <li><a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a> <span class="link-note">github.com/WeiGuang-2099</span></li>
          <li><a href={rss}>RSS 订阅</a> <span class="link-note">新文章的标题和摘要</span></li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="this-site">关于本站</h2>
        <p>用 Astro 构建，托管在 GitHub Pages 上。没有 UI 框架，也没有客户端框架；页面上的脚本只有主题切换、代码复制按钮和目录高亮。文章用中文写成，英文版由 DeepSeek 翻译。<a href={SITE.repo}>源码在 GitHub 上。</a></p>
      </div>
    ) : (
      <figure class="motto">
        <blockquote lang="zh-CN"><p>日就月将，学有缉熙于光明。</p></blockquote>
        <p class="motto-gloss">Gain a little each day and more each month; keep learning, and it gathers into light.</p>
        <figcaption><cite lang="zh-CN">《诗经·周颂·敬之》</cite></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="prose" lang="en">
        <p>Dawning (<span lang="zh-CN">缉熙</span>) is the pen name of an AI engineer who builds retrieval-augmented generation systems, multi-agent workflows and LLM applications. This site is a working notebook: design notes, failure modes, evaluations, and the occasional result that changed my mind.</p>

        <h2 id="the-name">The name</h2>
        <p><span lang="zh-CN">缉熙</span> comes from the Book of Songs (<span lang="zh-CN">《诗经·周颂·敬之》</span>) and describes learning that accumulates day by day until it turns into light. Dawning says the same thing in English: the sky growing lighter, and an idea slowly becoming clear. {first ? <a href={postUrl(first)}>The first post</a> : 'The first post'} tells the longer story.</p>

        <h2 id="elsewhere">Elsewhere</h2>
        <ul class="link-list">
          <li><a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a> <span class="link-note">github.com/WeiGuang-2099</span></li>
          <li><a href={rss}>RSS feed</a> <span class="link-note">new posts, with title and summary</span></li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="this-site">This site</h2>
        <p>Built with Astro and hosted on GitHub Pages. No UI framework, no client-side framework; the only scripts are the theme toggle, the copy buttons and the contents highlighter. The posts are written in Chinese, and the English versions are translated with DeepSeek. <a href={SITE.repo}>The source is on GitHub.</a></p>
      </div>
    )}
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
